WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:02.601
-And finally, guys,
I want to give a shout-out

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:04.434
to Rock &amp; Roll Hall of Famer
John Fogerty,

00:00:04.434 --> 00:00:07.334
who just kicked off his new
Celebration Tour this week.

00:00:07.334 --> 00:00:08.634
We love John Fogerty.

00:00:08.634 --> 00:00:10.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:12.434 --> 00:00:14.267
John stopped by the show
earlier today,

00:00:14.267 --> 00:00:16.400
so we stepped into
the "Tonight Show" music room

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.868
with The Roots, we grabbed
some classroom instruments

00:00:18.868 --> 00:00:21.601
and did our own version of the
Creedence Clearwater Revival hit

00:00:21.601 --> 00:00:23.200
"Lookin' Out My Back Door."

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.667
Check this out.

00:00:24.667 --> 00:00:26.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:26.767 --> 00:00:29.400
[ Up-tempo beat plays ]

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.367
[ Kazoo playing ]

00:00:31.367 --> 00:00:44.467
♪♪

00:00:44.467 --> 00:00:46.601
-♪ Just got home from Illinois ♪

00:00:46.601 --> 00:00:48.601
♪ Lock the front door, oh, boy ♪

00:00:48.601 --> 00:00:52.901
♪ Got to sit down,
take a rest on the porch ♪

00:00:52.901 --> 00:00:55.167
♪ Imagination sets in ♪

00:00:55.167 --> 00:00:57.434
♪ Pretty soon I'm singin' ♪

00:00:57.434 --> 00:01:01.434
-♪ Doo, doo, doo,
lookin' out my back door ♪

00:01:01.434 --> 00:01:03.934
-♪ There's a giant
doin' cartwheels ♪

00:01:03.934 --> 00:01:06.267
♪ A statue wearin' high heels ♪

00:01:06.267 --> 00:01:08.567
♪ Look at all
the happy creatures ♪

00:01:08.567 --> 00:01:10.367
♪ Dancin' on the lawn ♪

00:01:10.367 --> 00:01:12.601
♪ A dinosaur Victrola ♪

00:01:12.601 --> 00:01:15.067
♪ Listenin' to Buck Owens ♪

00:01:15.067 --> 00:01:18.901
-♪ Doo, doo, doo,
lookin' out my back door ♪

00:01:18.901 --> 00:01:21.300
-♪ Well, tambourines
and elephants ♪

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:23.334
♪ Are playin' in the band ♪

00:01:23.334 --> 00:01:26.868
♪ Won't you take a ride
on the flyin' spoon? ♪

00:01:26.868 --> 00:01:28.000
♪ Doo-doo-doo ♪

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.000
♪ Wondrous apparition ♪

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.300
♪ Provided by magician ♪

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:36.234
-♪ Doo, doo, doo,
lookin' out my back door ♪

00:01:36.234 --> 00:01:37.567
-Take it.

00:01:37.567 --> 00:01:49.467
♪♪

00:01:49.467 --> 00:01:51.968
♪ Forward troubles Illinois ♪

00:01:51.968 --> 00:01:54.167
♪ Lock the front door, oh, boy ♪

00:01:54.167 --> 00:01:56.400
♪ Look at all the happy
creatures ♪

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:58.534
♪ Dancin' on the lawn ♪

00:01:58.534 --> 00:02:01.133
♪ Bother me tomorrow ♪

00:02:01.133 --> 00:02:03.968
♪ Today I'll buy no sorrow ♪

00:02:03.968 --> 00:02:08.734
-♪ Doo, doo, doo,
lookin' out my back door ♪

00:02:08.734 --> 00:02:11.400
-Yeah.

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:16.100
♪ Doo, doo, doo,
lookin' out my back door ♪

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:18.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:20.968 --> 00:02:24.467
-Hey!
-Hey.

00:02:24.467 --> 00:02:27.634
-My thanks Shane, Tyler,
and John Fogerty.

